      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "감사해요!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n그렇지만, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> 님이 없었더라면\n이기지 못했을 거예요.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n다음에는 타격귀의 훌륭함도 보여 주세요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 3532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC10C0ACD574C694002100100001BE01000AADF8B807C9C0B9CC002C002000100002010000000020B2D8C7740020C5C6C5C8B354B77CBA74000AC774AE30C9C00020BABBD588C7440020AC70C608C694002E00100001BE00000AB2E4C74CC5D0B2940020D0C0ACA9ADC0C7580020D6CCB96DD568B3C40020BCF4C5EC0020C8FCC138C694002E00100002011401C90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "승패에 상관없이 상대를 칭찬할 줄 아는\n멋진 스포츠맨십이군요!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n이것이야말로 무도의 정신!\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> 씨도 멋졌습니다!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 3676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2B9D328C5D00020C0C1AD00C5C6C7740020C0C1B300B97C0020CE6DCC2CD5600020C9040020C544B294000ABA4BC9C40020C2A4D3ECCE20B9E8C2EDC774AD70C694002100100001BE01000AC774AC83C774C57CB9D0B85C0020BB34B3C4C7580020C815C2E00021000A00100002010000000020C528B3C40020BA4BC84CC2B5B2C8B2E4002100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
